
:SPECIAL_STATE
"proposes that $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP)"  /pres proposal $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP)  .
"proposed that $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP)"  /past proposal $obj(ST|QS|MSG|NP)  .

:STATE
"proposes that"                     /pres proposal              .
"proposed that"                     /past proposal              .
"intends: "                         /pres intent                .
"intended: "                        /past intent                .
"is pregnant by"                    /pres pregnant-by           .
"was pregnant by"                   /past pregnant-by           .
"is"                                /pres isa                   .
"was"                               /past isa                   .
"knows "                            /pres know                  .
"knew "                             /past know                  .

